the outer axes of `params` and `indices`. So the overall shape function is

>>> def batched_result_shape(p_shape, i_shape, axis=0, batch_dims=0):
...   return p_shape[:axis] + i_shape[batch_dims:] + p_shape[axis+1:]
>>>
